    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-200CBD6583775436-Q1">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 철자의 발음이 나머지 셋과 다른 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>철자</keyword>
        <keyword>발음</keyword>
        <keyword>나머지</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>géant</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · g의 발음
정답은 ①이다. g는 e, i, y 앞에서 [ʒ]로, a, o, u와 자음 앞에서 [g]로 발음한다. géant의 g는 [ʒ]이고 grève, garçon, légume의 g는 [g]이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>géant</choice_text>
          <commentary>géant이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>grève</choice_text>
          <commentary>grève의 g는 [g]이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>garçon</choice_text>
          <commentary>garçon의 g는 [g]이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>légume</choice_text>
          <commentary>légume의 g는 [g]이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2019년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-200CBD6583775436-Q2">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분의 쓰임이 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>쓰임</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Tu n'arrêtes pas &lt;u&gt;à&lt;/u&gt; parler.</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · 동사와 전치사
정답은 ③이다. finir de, commencer à, décider de는 옳은 구문이다. arrêter는 de와 함께 써서 arrêter de parler(말하는 것을 멈추다)가 되어야 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>J'ai fini &lt;u&gt;de&lt;/u&gt; lire ce livre.</choice_text>
          <commentary>finir de는 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Elle commence &lt;u&gt;à&lt;/u&gt; chanter.</choice_text>
          <commentary>commencer à는 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Tu n'arrêtes pas &lt;u&gt;à&lt;/u&gt; parler.</choice_text>
          <commentary>arrêter de가 되어야 하므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Il a décidé &lt;u&gt;de&lt;/u&gt; partir à la campagne.</choice_text>
          <commentary>décider de는 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
