          <commentary>㉠이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>dont ce qui</choice_text>
          <commentary>dont, ce qui이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
